TEXT 80 1712 Left 2 !* Output IDT: Ultra-Wideband BVD model
TEXT 80 1744 Left 2 !Lm_O  INT   NL_O   0.397u
TEXT 80 1760 Left 2 !Cm_O  NL_O  NC_O   636p
TEXT 80 1776 Left 2 !Rm_O  NC_O  VOUT   50
TEXT 80 1808 Left 2 !Rload VOUT  0      50
TEXT 80 1840 Left 2 ;
TEXT 80 1872 Left 2 !* Envelope detector (Optimized speed to ignore nulls)
